---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<aside class="awareness" aria-labelledby="aware-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 26 30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 1.5 2 5.5v8.2c0 7 4.6 12.2 11 14.8 6.4-2.6 11-7.8 11-14.8V5.5L13 1.5Z"/><path d="M13 9v8M13 20.5v.5"/></svg>
    <div>
      <h2 id="aware-title">Investor awareness<span class="tbc">Wording to be confirmed by compliance</span></h2>
      <p>Ironclad never offers or assures guaranteed returns, and never asks you to pay into a personal account. Invest only into accounts held in the name of the fund or scheme. If someone contacts you claiming to represent Ironclad, verify with us at {site.email} before you act.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
